    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming detached property in the centre of the popular coastal village of Kilmuckridge \r\n\r\n‘Westwinds’ is a substantial detached  five-bedroom residence, extending to approximately 147 sq. m., conveniently located only metres from the centre of Kilmuckridge village and the north Wexford coastline.\r\n\r\nThe property offers particularly generous and flexible accommodation, with the ground floor comprising an entrance porch, spacious living room, kitchen, dining room, family room, two bedrooms and two bathrooms. Upstairs there are three further bedrooms, bathroom and useful storage.\r\n\r\nWhile the house is in need of some refurbishment and modernisation throughout, its size and layout offer excellent potential to create a spacious family home.\r\n\r\nExternally, there is off-street parking together with an attached garage offering useful storage and further potential. In addition, this house benefits from a particularly large garden which, given its central location, could have additional development potential (SPP).\r\n\r\nKilmuckridge village provides a good range of shops, primary and secondary schools, pubs, restaurants and everyday amenities, while the renowned beaches at Morriscastle and the surrounding coastline are just a short drive away.\r\n\r\n‘Westwinds’ represents an excellent opportunity for all seeking a sizeable property with significant potential in a convenient central location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t\t\r\nSitting room            \t3.7m  x 3.9m\r\nFeature fireplace.\r\nLiving room\t                      4.7m x 3.9m\r\nFeature fireplace, built-in storage.\r\nKitchen\t                      3.6m x 2.6m\r\nRange of wall and floor units, gas cooker, fridge/freezer.\r\nDining room                     \t2.6m x 2.6m\r\nBathroom\t                     2.0m x 2.7m\r\nBath, w.h.b, w.c, partially tiled walls, tiled flooring.\r\nFamily room                     \t4.8m x 2.9m\r\nFeature fireplace.\r\nBedroom 2\t                     2.2m x 3.6m\r\nBedroom 3\t                     2.2m x 3.6m\r\nShower room\t          1.4m x 1.5m\r\nElectric shower, w.h.b, w.c, partially tiled walls.\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding\t\t\t\r\nPrimary bedroom \t\t3.7m x 3.8m\r\nDual aspect windows, built-in wardrobe, timber flooring.\r\nEnsuite\t\t\t1.1m x 2.3m\r\nElectric shower, w.h.c, w.c, fully tiled walls and floor.\r\nBedroom 4\t\t\t2.4m x 2.9m\r\nBuilt-in wardrobe, timber flooring.\r\nBedroom 5\t\t\t2.6m x 3.8m\r\nBuilt-in wardrobe, timber flooring."
